window.products.push({"id":242055,"name":"It's My F***ING Birthday Satin Sash - Funny Birthday Party Decorations - 21st Birthday","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w+RSl8vdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's my F**KING Birthday, B*tch! QUALITY: What happens when you take a beautiful black sash, laser printing, and glitter? You get our premium quality birthday sash. It is fun, playful, durable, and best of all, reusable. SIZE: The sash is a one size fits all. One side measures approximately 3 ft. long and 3 inches wide. FUNNY: One day a year you get to be f-ed up as you please. Notice the laser glitter. Laser. Glitter. That S**T is sick. GUARANTEE: We stand by our sashes with a 100% money back guarantee. If this birthday party banner does not make you and your loved ones smile, then your money back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w+RSl8vdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sterling James Co.","source_asin":"B01A9BF9KK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A9BF9KK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A9BF9KK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":242056,"name":"Hamilton Beach Deluxe Set & Forget 6 Quart Slow Cooker (33862)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711PElhqzYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For the cook who is busy all day but wants a home- cooked dinner at night, a slow cooker is the answer. And with the Set & Forget Programmable Slow Cooker, technology takes a big leap forward from the outdated slow cookers found in yesterday’s kitchens. In addition to offering modern convenience, the Set & Forget Programmable Slow Cooker has three choices for easy, automatic cooking: program, probe and manual mode. On busy days, program the cooking time and Set & Forget Slow Cooker automatically shifts to keep warm when the cooking time is up. Cooking a large cut of meat like pot roast, chicken, or pork tenderloin? Insert the probe, set the desired meat temperature and the Set & Forget Slow Cooker automatically shifts to keep warm when the temperature is reached. For traditional slow cooking, manually select the high, low or warm temperature without setting a cooking time. For “one-pot” simplicity, nothing beats slow cooking. But when it comes to bringing hot meals to parties and potlucks, spills can be a concern. With the travel-friendly Set & Forget Slow Cooker, messes aren’t an issue. When you need to take your home-cooked meal on the road, the Set & Forget Slow Cooker’s clip-locked, secure lid has a tight seal to help ensure that your shirt and your car arrive without a messy spill. In or out of the house, the Set & Forget Programmable Slow Cooker not only makes slow cooking easy, it has travel neatly wrapped up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711PElhqzYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B003UV8L70","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003UV8L70","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003UV8L70","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
