window.products.push({"id":242067,"name":"ST-X2 Professional Garment Steamer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZQ8RkdE1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"* Steamer heats up in just 45 seconds  * Easy fill, removable water tank  * 1.9L/ half gallon capacity provides over 70 minutes of continuous steam  * Garment steamer automatically shuts off when too hot or short of water * Drain plug for easy maintenance * Removable fabric brush attachments sweep away unwanted threads, lint and  * Roll casters for easy movement  * Item height extends from 36' to 65' * Telescopic pole for compact storage  * Warranty: 180 day - Manufacturer * Dimensions: 10 in. W x 11 in. H x 7 in. L rod: 62 in. H This innovative 1450 Watts garment steamer will refresh and sanitize your clothing. Removes wrinkles as well as odors by its continuous flow of steam penetrating to your garment and ensure you professional dry cleaning quality results. Steam X2 Steamer heats up in just 45 seconds and has an easy to fill removable water tank that holds enough water up to 70 minutes of continuous steam. Its adjustable telescopic rod design and rolling caster makes it easier for compact storage. For safety, The Smartek steamer as a built-in automatic shut off that will automatically reset itself. The 5 feet flexible hose is covered with a durable head resistant fabric.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZQ8RkdE1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smartek","source_asin":"B001A3IB4I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001A3IB4I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001A3IB4I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":242068,"name":"Deco 79 47526 Aluminum Enamel Tray, 12\"/16\"/19\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QOeTf05nL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"A set of trays that come in three sizes can be a boon for the homemaker. These particular ones are no frill, thus simple and hence most easy to use! elegance can be the figurative name for these aluminum trays in a set of 3. Made using quality cent percent aluminum, these trays are sure to last in great condition for years to come. They feature a mirror finish border and the main surface that leans on the silver colored side. These aluminum trays are very strong and stable because of the way they are constructed. This means that you can make full use of them as trays: thus you can carry items like pizzas on them, or you can keep heavier things too. Easy to maintain, which means all You'll need to do is dust and wipe them once in a while, these trays can also make for a brilliant gifts for someone who does the cooking and serving. Indeed, you will be praised for your choice. So get them today!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QOeTf05nL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco 79","source_asin":"B00ZS8DRBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZS8DRBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZS8DRBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
