window.products.push({"id":242116,"name":"Cozy Blankets Wool Blanket/Throw Crafted from 100% New Zealand Wool, Virgin Wool Blanket with Soft Fringe and Tartan Pattern in Chocolate Latte Brown ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xRuy88C0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxurious, High-Quality Cozy Blankets and Throws Live naturally and comfortably with Cozy Blankets exquisite wool blankets. Made of 100% New Zealand sheep's wool, our resilient sheep's wool blankets feature all-new, natural materials crafted in our European-based factory using strict quality control measures. With classic tartan pattern and chic color combinations, these high-quality virgin wool blankets bring timeless style to your living space. Easy Comfort in Any Season A versatile choice, wool helps keep you dry and comfortable in both cold and warm weather. Wool's natural crimp creates air pockets that retain heat while repelling moisture. The result is a breathable, absorbent and insulating fabric that constantly reacts to changes in body temperature, making it ideal for seasonal use. Grab a soft blanket and curl up on the sofa with a good book, use it as an outdoor blanket at your next picnic or pack it for warmth on your yearly camping trip. 100% Natural and Renewable New Zealand Wool Blankets Sheep produce new fleece every year. Part of a natural cycle, the wool is biodegradable and recyclable, and it uses less energy than man-made fibers during manufacture. A durable choice, wool blankets are long-lasting and odor resistant, so you can use them for years to come. Non-allergenic and Asthma Safe Wool naturally absorbs and filters unwanted odors and allergens like dust and pollen; it is also a non-allergenic fiber that doesn't promote the growth of bacteria. In addition, wool is naturally flame-retardant and won't burn until it reaches 700 degrees Celsius. This makes New Zealand wool comforters a safe and sensible choice for family and guests. Easy Care Our washable wool blankets feature a natural protective coating that is resistant to stains and dust. Cozy Blankets can be machine washed and tumble dried, so you can enjoy their soft and cozy comfort for years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xRuy88C0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozy Blankets","source_asin":"B0BKKD9GQX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKKD9GQX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKKD9GQX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
