window.products.push({"id":242285,"name":"100% Contamination Free Cotton Percale Sheets Set, Full Size, Rose Pink, Deep Pocket, 4 Piece - 1 Flat, 1 360-Degree Elastic All-Around Fitted Sheet, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711yzkqN6lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% CONTAMINATION FREE COTTON SHEETS SET: Made with cotton imported from Brazil, weaved into crisp percale sheets fabric and dyed using the latest technology to insure you get the optimum product. These temperature balancing sheets keep you cool throughout the night. Authenticated 200 thread count fabric used in these cotton sheets is distinctively crisp, durable and light weight. Percale bed sheets are very breathable and sweat wicking. DURABLE MACHINE WASHABLE: Aiming to be affordable and easy to care for, our Percale sheets are made with contamination-free long staple cotton imported from Brazil which insures life and quality. Each wash increases long staple cotton’s softness and wrinkles can be avoided if they are folded or spread right out of the machine IMPORTED PERCALE FITTED SHEETS SET – 4-piece cotton Full sheet set: 1 - Flat sheet (81’’ x 96’’), 2 - Pillowcase (20’’ x 30’’), 1- Cotton fitted sheet (54’’ x 75’' + 15’’) with 1’’ elastic all around with a 15’’ drop for deep mattresses make it a worthy cool percale 200 TC sheets. Imported, light weight, cooling and absorbent 100% crisp cotton Percale weave. Percales tend to get softer with each wash. Wash before first use. SKIN FRIENDLY NATURAL COTTON & EASY CUSTOMER SERVICE - Our Percale sheets comply with strict quality control and is made using fabric that ensure that the color is retained after several washes by the process of Sanforizeing & Mercerizing. Our own customer service team can be contacted to resolve any issues you may face after purchasing our product. We aim to satisfy, even if that means accepting returns. SIZE GUIDE: Twin sheets 1pc 66\"x96\" flat sheets, 1pc 39\"x75\" +15\" fitted sheets, 1pc 20\"x30\" pillowcase. Full sheets include 1pc 81\"x96\" flat sheets, 1pc 54\"x75\" +15\" fitted sheets, 2pc 20\"x30\" pillowcase. Queen sheets include 1pc 90\"x102\" flat sheets, 1pc 60\"x80\" +15\" fitted sheets, 2pc 20\"x30\" pillowcase. King sheets include 1pc 108\"x102\" flat sheets, 1pc 78\"x80\" +15\" fitted sheets, 2pc 20\"x40\" pillowcase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711yzkqN6lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Just Cotton Plus","source_asin":"B0BMW7KCLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMW7KCLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMW7KCLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
