window.products.push({"id":242310,"name":"Balsam Hill 6.5ft Premium Unlit Artificial Christmas Tree Woodland Spruce with Storage Bag, and Fluffing Gloves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916q88EG5YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About the Product Simple beauty is what the Woodland Spruce is all about. It features a lush blend of our signature True Needle and Classic Needle foliage, this narrow spruce artificial Christmas tree captures the elegance of nature. Attached, hinged branches fold outward for a quick and easy setup. A statuesque silhouette and a dark green color make this tree a captivating focal point for your holiday decorating. Highly Realistic PE True Needle™ Foliage Our exclusive True Needle™ technology uses injection-molded PE plastic to mimic the look and feel of genuine evergreen needles, giving our lifelike trees an unmatched level of realism. Our PVC Classic Needles are used to create most of our traditional trees and provide fullness at an affordable price. These are the soft, papery, and flat needles found on traditional artificial Christmas trees. Multiple Lighting Options (1) Traditional timeless incandescent lights with classic glass casings and commercial-grade filamentsthat stay lit for 3,000+ hours, and patented technology ensures if one bulb burns out or is removed, the rest remain lit. (2) Our exclusive Candlelight™ LED lights cast a soft glow similar to regular incandescent bulbs unlike traditional LEDs that emit bright white light and won't burn out. (3) Multicolored LED Lights offer the same technology as our Candlelight Clear LEDs but add a festival of holiday colors. About the Brand Balsam Hill’s mission is to create the world’s most luxurious and realistic artificial Christmas trees, and we are committed to providing our customers with a picture-perfect holiday. With innovative technologies our trees let you sit back and enjoy Christmas to the fullest. We also have a selection of beautiful wreaths, garlands, and Christmas decorations to put the finishing touches to your home this holiday season.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916q88EG5YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Balsam Hill","source_asin":"B08NFP12DH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NFP12DH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NFP12DH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
