window.products.push({"id":242398,"name":"haodeni 2 Sets 3D Big Lip Mirror Wall Stickers Acrylic Kiss Mirror Wall Decals DIY Art Self-Adhesive Wallpaper Murals Decoration for Bedroom, Living R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TZjhwPSEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful big lip mirror art wall stickers create a bright and warm family, it will add life to your house and create a full of love atmosphere. Packing liste: You will receive 2 set (4pcs) of big lip mirror wall stickers, including red and silver. Different colors are enough to meet your various decorative needs, unleash your artistic imagination to create a warm and romantic home for your family. Size information: The finished product size is about 14.1*5.1in / 36*13cm, you can DIY to accommodate different sized walls. Upper lip 13.8*2in / 35.*5.1cm(2pcs) Lower lip 14.1*3.1in / 36*8cm(2pcs) Material: High-quality acrylic material, which work better on flat and smooth walls. How to use: 1. Thoroughly clean the surface to be pasted. 2. Remove the back adhesive paper, then put them on wall or other surface. 3. Remove the film from the surface, make the mirror stickers bright. Note: 1. Please stick to the position before sticking the wall sticker, and try not to reuse it. Otherwise, cracks are likely to occur. 2. If the wall stickers are not tight enough, you can use electric wind to blow against the gap of the glue for a while, and then lightly adhere it, it will become stronger. 3. If you stick them on uneven or wet, dusty walls, they may come off in a few days. Each order is unique for us and we carefully produce it to meet your needs for an easy solution to home decoration. If you find a problem or tear during the pasting process, please contact us. We will try our best to satisfy you. Thank you! Happy shopping!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TZjhwPSEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"haodeni","source_asin":"B09WTVKZ2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WTVKZ2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WTVKZ2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
