window.products.push({"id":242510,"name":"Modern Dining Chairs Set of 4, PU Faux Leather High Back Upholstered Dining Room Side Chair with Horizontal Stripe Backrest Design for Kitchen Living ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S5h5vwleL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MODERN DESIGN】A modern style dining chair that is perfect for interiors. The sturdy dining chairs are complete with C-shaped chrome base for a uniquely modern look, with anti-scratch plastic feet on the bottom to prevent damage to the floor. Leather upholstered fabric chairs will make any home feel like a luxury hotel. 【STABLE STRUCTURE】The legs are constructed with a curved tubular steel frame that maintains a clean design aesthetic while maintaining solid rigid support. Enhance your dining experience with these stylish and functional chairs. The lightweight frames make transporting them a breeze, so you can enjoy them in any room of your home. 【ERGONOMIC DESIGN】The PU leather fabric gives you enough comfort and the high-quality foam makes you feel no pressure on your back. This perfect dining chair will be the best choice for your dining, living, or kitchen room. It's an affordable way to decorate your home with a chic style! Add stylish comfort to your home. 【MULTI-PURPOSE】The best-designed dining chair with lasting charm is one of the best pieces of furniture to change the style of your interior. Weight capacity of up to 250 pounds, which can guarantee long-time use without damage. Can be used in the dining room, kitchen, living room, bedroom, dining room, powder room, study, etc. 【EASY TO ASSEMBLE】Our modern-style dining chair is very easy to put the legs on. This chair can be assembled in less than 10 minutes. All hardware and parts are included. If you have any questions about our product, just feel free to contact us and we will solve every problem for you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S5h5vwleL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baysitone","source_asin":"B0C1T24S9C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1T24S9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1T24S9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":242511,"name":"Ban.do Deluxe Hot Stuff Insulated Thermal Travel Mug, 16 Ounces, But First Coffee (gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q7Lah73GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FITS IN MOST CUP HOLDERS: Insulated mug measures 3 inches x 8 inches x 3 inches and holds 16 ounces. Slim travel mug is comfortable to carry and easily fits in most standard cup holders DOUBLE WALLED TUMBLER: Vacuum-insulated construction keeps your beverage hot or cold for hours at a time (without the mug changing temperature and becoming too hot or cold to touch!). Double walled design keeps your coffee mug from being covered in condensation, so your desk or car never get messy again! SPILL PROOF: Travel mug is made of insulated, double-wall acrylic with a spill proof plastic lid. Screw on lid has a flap opening that can be used with one hand, which makes drinking on the go suuuuper easy EASY CARE: Mug can only be hand washed but the opening is large enough (3 inches wide) for hassle-free cleaning. Thermal mug cannot be used in the microwave but holds both hot and cold contents QUALITY DESIGN: 16 oz mug is made without BPA, lead, and phthalate, keeping your beverage rid of any harsh flavors or ingredients. The fun, metallic design stands out among your ordinary mugs and is perfect for busy mornings on the go. Ideal for all ages, as it is the perfect tea mug, coffee cup, or hot chocolate cup","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q7Lah73GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ban.do","source_asin":"B01HG7CPK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HG7CPK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HG7CPK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":242512,"name":"Doodle White Placemats With Plate Design, to Colour-in and Personalize, with Wash-out Fabric Markers included (Set of 4 White Place Mats)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517zXVrEsiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Doodle by Stitch 100-Percent Cotton Canvas Place Setting Placemat/Pen Set—Meals just got fun! Who said that dinner had to be boring? Draw, eat and draw some more. Whether it’s mealtime, a birthday party or simply a way to get a special message across, the Doodle Placemats are the answer. The Doodle placemat looks like a meal setting complete with plate, fork spoon and knife. You have an empty slate to make your own design. When you are ready for a new look, simply machine wash and dry your placemats and start all over again. Constructed from top quality 100-percent panama cotton canvas ensures placemats that are durable enough to handle spills and everyday use. Each placemat measures 13 by 18-inch. Set includes 4-placemats and eight wash-out fabric pens. For even more fun add the Doodle tablecloth. Doodle by Stitch, Aprons, Duvets, pillowcases, Tablecloths and extra pen sets also available thru Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517zXVrEsiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"eatsleepdoodle","source_asin":"B008KYN57S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008KYN57S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008KYN57S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":242513,"name":"Joyce Chen J Classic 14 Inch Xylan Non-Stick Flat Bottom 4 Piece Wok Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4128GK0VZ4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Part of the Classic Carbon Steel Series by Joyce Chen, the 14\" Non-stick Flat Bottom Wok Set, Includes; Wok, Dome Lid, 12\" Bamboo Spatula, and recipe booklet. The Flat Bottom Wok with Xylan non-stick coating is a heavy weight at 1.8 mm of carbon steel. It is made for use on gas or electric burners and the pan's heavy weight carbon steel body is designed for rapid, even heating and cooling ¿ a must for any stir-fry. Its generous size will enable you to make delicious Asian meals for your entire family. These heavy weight carbon steel pans will render superior cooking performance for life. This pan is perfect for creating such authentic Asian-style recipes as curried shrimp with lemon rice and Szechwan beef stir-fry. The pan features a Blonde wood handle and the flat bottom sits securely on stove tops. The wood handle is designed to stay cool on the stovetop, so you can easily remove the pan from the burner without using potholders. The Xylan Non Stick coating allows you to cook with little or no oil - a healthy delicious cooking method that brings out the food's natural flavors. Joyce Chen's slogan \"Eastern Cookware for the Western Kitchen,\" reflects her focus on providing high-quality, versatile tools and products that have Asian flair, but can be used in a western kitchen. Today, Joyce Chen Products come from all over the Pacific Rim to bring the best of Asia to you. Joyce Chen opened her first restaurant in Cambridge, Massachusetts in 1958. The restaurant flourished, and in 1973 a larger Cambridge restaurant was opened. Chen also began writing Chinese cookbooks and in the 1970s began hosting a cooking show on public television. She found that the selection and quality of Chinese cookware in America didn't live up to her high standards¿ so she developed her own.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4128GK0VZ4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYCE CHEN","source_asin":"B0000DDVUD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000DDVUD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000DDVUD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
