window.products.push({"id":242572,"name":"Ceramic & Titanium Non-Stick Frying Pan With Lid - 11 inch Dishwasher & Oven Safe Scratch Resistant Cookware With Induction Plate - By Copper Master","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711AQ10BOBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Making a home cooked meal for guests and loved ones doesn’t have to be stressful! With the right staple products, your time in the kitchen can be a breeze! Nothing is more annoying than trying to scrape sticky and stubborn food remnants off your pan, leaving nasty scratches and scrapes in its place. NO MORE SCRAPING & SCRATCHING YOUR POTS & PANS! WITH COPPER MASTER’S 11 INCH CERAMIC & TITANIUM FRYING PAN WITH LID, FOOD SLIDES RIGHT OFF WITHOUT BUTTER OR OIL! Without the need for unhealthy fats, you can fry and cook diet friendly nutritious dinners. Eating healthy just got that much easier! FEATURES: Ceramic & Titanium Scratch & Scrape Resistant Non-Stick Technology Stainless Steel Induction Cooking Plate Oven Safe Up To 500 Degrees Extra handle for convenience Dishwasher Safe Glass Lid Makes A Great Gift PTFE/PFOA/PFOS Free Made with non stick ceramic and super strong titanium, you’ll never have to worry about food sticking to this sauce pot. Our cookware is resistant to scratches and scrapes, making it perfectly safe to use metal utensils when cooking. THIS REVOLUTIONARY NON-STICK FRYING PAN IS DISHWASHER & OVEN SAFE! Clean up is a breeze with this pot. Due to the non stick surface there is hardly any clean up required and it’s dishwasher safe! Our cookware is durable enough to withstand up to 500 degrees of heat! OUR NON STICK COOKWARE WILL CHANGE YOUR LIFE! You can make virtually any meal in a cinch with minimal clean up! It even melts cheese without any sticking or scraping. Our cookware is also nontoxic and safe to use for the whole family! Copper Master’s Ceramic & Titanium Frying Pan makes a great gift for just about anyone, and makes an especially thoughtful housewarming & hostess gift. Get yours today and transform your cooking experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711AQ10BOBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Copper Master","source_asin":"B01LZJBFOW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZJBFOW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZJBFOW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
