window.products.push({"id":242584,"name":"Craftsworth 100% Cotton Percale Fitted Sheet Twin XL Size Beige Fitted Sheet Only Cool Crisp Deep Pocket Fitted Sheet Soft Silky Hotel Luxury Quality","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XdxuomBeL._AC_.jpg","description":"GATEWAY TO GUILT FREE SLEEP: We can’t wait for you to experience our 100% Pure Cotton Percale Twin XL Fitted Sheet which epitomizes both luxury & comfort. These sheets are made from 100% pure Cotton. Let’s unpack - 1 all around fully elasticized Deep Pocket Fitted Sheet (39\" × 80\" + 15\" Allround Elastic). SUSTAINABLE IS OUR MANTRA: Sustainability isn’t a buzz word for us. We go great lengths to get sustainably produced Premium quality Percale Sheets & use this in our certified factories to conjure the best ever 300-thread count 100% Cotton Percale Fitted Sheets. FEEL THE COOL COMFORT: Densely woven in rich Percale weave, our bed sheets keep you cool, comfortable, and breathable in all seasons. These premium Percale sheets comes with anti-pilling finish. Our sheets are soft, and crisp — and rustle when you roll onto the bed. CERTIFIED, VERIFIED, & EASY TO MAINTAIN: Sink in the comfort of our 100% Cotton sheets that are natural, unlike microfiber. These sheet set are certified as STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX. To maintain the softness, we would recommend to regular laundering. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We provide exceptional customer service in case you ever have an issue. For any reason, if you don’t love your bed sheets, we will return or replace your order within 30 days as per Amazon Guidelines. Our sheets are perfect for Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, or Valentine’s Day. Best for any room in your house - kid’s room, guest room, bedroom, or vacation home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XdxuomBeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CRAFTSWORTH","source_asin":"B0BJQ9X7ZD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJQ9X7ZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJQ9X7ZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
