window.products.push({"id":242623,"name":"SWEET & LAMB COLLECTION Salt Cellar – Salt Container with Lid, Spoon, & Nonslip Tray – Beautifully Crafted Magnetic Closure & Tight Seal – Salt Box wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619BtfgXlxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE IDEAL SALT CONTAINER with lid is TIGHTLY CONSTRUCTED out of a dense wood that will keep salt and spices FRESH and protected. But many salt storage cellars are made with low-quality materials that CRACK and BREAK after just a few weeks. At Sweet & Lamb, we craft our Salt Cellar set out of HARDY, DURABLE natural ACACIA WOOD, prepared with mineral oil for LONG-LASTING PROTECTION against cracks, warping, and weather changes. DON’T SETTLE for other salt keeper containers with LOOSE LIDS that leave your salts and spices EXPOSED. Our wood salt box is designed with a THICKER RIM and LID for increased protection & FRESHNESS, with a MAGNETIC closure to ensure that your salt jar stays closed. EASY TO OPEN with one hand while cooking, this salt holder for counter makes your food prep SIMPLER and smoother than the average hard-to-open salt jar. THIS COMPLETE SALT DISH SET includes a salt pepper container, matching SALT CELLAR SPOON, and TRAY BASE with designated spaces for your salt bowl and spoon, as well as rubberized feet for EXTRA STABILITY on any surface. CREATE your own SEASONINGS, RUBS, and MIXES and store them in this handy salt and pepper box for secure storage and EASY ACCESS. THE PERFECT GIFT for the HOME GOURMET! Not only does this gorgeous salt container with lid and spoon make a HANDSOME addition to the dining table, it is also the ideal storage salt bin for HOME CHEFS who are fans of gourmet salts and love concocting their own SPICES. Give this salt dish with lid and spoon as a HOUSEWARMING GIFT, host or hostess gift, or cooking gift! AT SWEET & LAMB, WE’RE DEDICATED to creating luxury home goods that strike the IDEAL BALANCE of QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP and BEAUTIFUL DESIGN. Quality and durability are top of mind when we craft our products, and we aim to make salt cellars that are A STEP ABOVE THE AVERAGE. Our customers are our top priority. If you don’t love your salt storage container, our team is standing by to help make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619BtfgXlxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SWEET & LAMB COLLECTION","source_asin":"B0B3JDW6HV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3JDW6HV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3JDW6HV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
