window.products.push({"id":242856,"name":"St Patricks Day Pillow Covers 18x18 Set of 4, St Patricks Day Decorations, Gnome Pillow Covers Decoration Clover Lucky Decoration Happy Shamrock Throw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GmFLXt9jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 4 Classic Collection St. Patrick's Day Ornaments Perfect for farm, balcony, living room, bedroom, patch, office, garden, car and more. Our St. Patrick's Day Throw Pillow Covers can help you quickly change up your St. Patrick's Day decorations. This festive throw sham will refresh your room and is easy to mix and match with other St. Patrick's Day decorative pillows or decorations. This sham is perfect for sofas, beds, couches, chairs, cars and more. It can create a good St. Patrick's Day atmosphere for your living room, bedroom, office, etc. Material: 100% Polyester. Fabric color: Linen. Use and Cleaning: Recommended for indoor use. Machine wash warm or hand wash, do not dry clean, do not iron, tumble dry on medium heat, do not bleach. Why choose us? High-quality cotton and linen material Made of high-quality breathable linen material, it is soft against the skin, comfortable and durable, can be used outdoors, and is easy to care for. Invisible zipper Hidden zipper adds an elegant look and allows you to tuck in your pillow/filler with ease Are you worried about color difference, quality and workmanship. Afraid of being attracted by pictures? You care about the problems we're trying to solve. We control the quality from the source, selecting fabrics and wires. Strictly control every process, color fastness, and material durability. The only thing we do is to ensure every detail and warm every family. Throw pillows provide a warm and cozy way to accessorize any interior. The overall color palette and room decor often dictate the type of pillows to choose. But with pillowcases, there are even more options for experimenting with them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GmFLXt9jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LMAZG","source_asin":"B0BP6QW9QH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6QW9QH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6QW9QH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
