window.products.push({"id":242863,"name":"Chefman Digital Display Removable Tea Infuser Included, Cool Touch Handle, 360° Swivel Base, BPA Free, 1.7 Liter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LDknrtn9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAXIMUM CONTROL FOR OPTIMAL BREWING. Get more precise results out of your kettle with the Chef man Programmable Electric Kettle with Digital Touch Display. It has accurate digital temperature control for optimal brewing of various beverages, making it ideal for making hot water for tea, coffee, instant oatmeal, baby bottles and more! Spend less time waiting for your delicious hot beverages - it boils water faster than the microwave or the stovetop methods. Feel like watching your water boil? The kettle lights up with bright LEDs while the water is boiling so you know when it’s complete. If one cup isn’t enough – no worries! The Keep Warm function stays at desired temperature for up to an hour, so you can keep your tea or water hot, and have another cup without having to re-boil! You can lift the kettle easily from its base for cordless filling at the sink and graceful pouring without the hassle of a power cord. It can also be returned to its power source from any direction, great for right and left-handed users. With a cool-touch handle, you can lift the teakettle easily and without burning your hand. No need to worry about this kettle boiling dry, the boil-dry feature automatically turns the kettle off when there is little or no water left. Micro-mesh infuser included with purchase so you can brew your favorite loose-leaf or bagged teas directly in the stain-resistant borosilicate glass kettle, allowing you to get the perfect flavor every time. For easy cleaning, the tea infuser is removable. Go ahead, enjoy tea the way it’s meant to be!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LDknrtn9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B08FSC981M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FSC981M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FSC981M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":242864,"name":"TreeWool (Pack of 2) Decorative Throw Pillow Covers Fleur Accent in 100% Cotton Canvas (22 x 22 Inches, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q2rfx7mWL._AC_SL1353_.jpg","description":"Brand : TreeWool Box Contains : 2 Piece Cushion Cover / Shell only. Cushions are not included.   Carefully hand finished for a superior quality Cushion Cover that is sure to add a great accent to your living room, lounge or bedroom. PRODUCT FEATURES 1. Each unit is made with 100% light weight cotton canvas for increased durability  2. Each unit has a high quality hidden / concealed zipper, that allows for easy insertion and removal of pillow inserts  3. In the inside, all fabric edges are stitched with overlock stitches to avoid fray and increase durability of cushion covers  4. These throw pillow cases are suitable for use in sofa / couch & beds  5. Fully machine washable in cold setting. To increase the life of your cushion covers, follow the care instructions provided in the label. GOOD TO KNOW BEFORE YOU BUY 1. Due to differences in color saturation settings between each Computer, Laptop, Tablet or Phone the actual product might have a minor color difference to the picture on screen. 2. As each product is entirely handmade, there may be minor size variation ( + or - 0.5 cm ) CHOOSING THE RIGHT PILLOW COVERS (OR) PILLOWS 1. Measure 2 adjacent sides of existing pillows. This will give the size of the pillow cover to choose. E.g., if the pillow is 16 x 16 Inch on the sides, then the pillow cover to choose is 16 x 16 Inch. 2. If buying new pillows, then a) Choose either the same size pillows as the pillow covers (e.g., 16x16 Inch Cover = 16x16 Inch Pillow) (OR) b) Choose up to a maximum of 2 inch bigger pillows than the pillow covers to get a full and plump pillows.(e.g., 16x16 Inch Cover = Up to 18x18 Inch Pillow) ABOUT TREEWOOL We bring our expertise in Home Fashion sector in Europe to the US.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q2rfx7mWL._AC_SL1353_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TreeWool","source_asin":"B0743J1YT7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0743J1YT7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0743J1YT7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":242865,"name":"LIVEBOX Boho Shower Curtain, 72x72 Inches Black and White Fabric Tassel Triangle Stripes Geometric Shower Curtain Set with Hooks Tribal Bathroom Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mRmThHN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIVEBOX Shower Curtain Set Black and White Shower Curtain Bohemian Geometric Design with Tassels shower curtains for bathroomWhat size should a shower curtain be for a bathroom?The first thing to keep in mind is how and where you want to attach them. Most shower curtains come in a standard 72-inch length and are between 70-72 inches wide. If you have a walk-in unit, you'll want a curtain that's about 78 inches long. For a standing shower, the curtains need to be long enough to reach the floor. If you need curtains for the bathtub, however, you probably want shorter curtains.What material should a bathroom shower curtain to choose?If you want to throw your shower curtain into the washing machine, your best bet is to look for one made from a durable polyester fabric material, though any non-fabric curtains can still be wiped down with a cloth. On top of that, a hookless shower curtain (with reinforced metal grommets) can make it much less of a chore to remove the curtain from its rod and eliminates the need for you to buy separate hooks.Product Features:Color: black and whiteMaterial：100% soft polyesterTechnique: printed technologyPattern: triangle and strips geometricSize: 36x72 inch, 60x72 inch, 72x72 inch,72x75 inch or 72x78 inchPackage Included: 1 boho shower curtain and 12 plastic hooksAffordable & Elegant: These tassels designs add elegantly mysterious elements while fitting almost of your budgets!Satisfaction Guarantee:If you are not satisfied with tribal shower curtain, plz feel free to contact us. We stand by our area rugs 100% and want all of our customers to love them as much as we do!Cleaning Instructions:machine wash in cold water with mild detergent, color will not fade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mRmThHN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIVEBOX","source_asin":"B08CZJ14T2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZJ14T2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZJ14T2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
