window.products.push({"id":242911,"name":"Avolare Cooling Comforter Queen, Double Sided Summer Comforter with Q-Max>0.4 Arc-Chill Cold Touch Fiber & 100% Cotton[Oeko-TEX], All Season Soft Fluf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tV3aF9ZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【Ultra cooling material】Whether you are a night sweat or not, sleeping with Avolare cooling comforter makes summer night so much better.It promotes coolness and softness with a unique Arc-Chill Q-Max>0.4 fabric. It absorbs heat quickly and cools down by 2-4°C at a touch. So it can calm anxiety, soothe the senses and help you fall asleep in total cooling comfort. Using Avolare cooling comforter, you can not only enjoy the silky touch of a silk comforter, but also feel cooler than ever before. ❄️【Double Side Design】Avolare cooling comforter adopts double-side design, ideal for all year used. You can flip it according to temperature and weather conditions to provide a full range of comfort in all seasons. One side is made with jade fiber, silky and cooling, keeping cold on hot night, while the other side is made with 100% cotton, soft and breathable, keeping warm on cool night. Using Avolare cooling blanket, you will get a better experience and a wider usable range than silk comforter. ❄️【Ultra Soft & Fluffy】The inside of all season down alternative comforter is filled with DACRON fiber to form a 3D hollow structure with high elasticity and compression, which makes cooling comforter lightweight and fluffy, making you feel as if you are sleeping on a cloud bed. Besides, Avolare comforter makes the filler uniform distribution and quality through the single-needle quilting technique. The filling would not move or clump even after washing, with zero concern of leakage or ripping. ❄️【Breathable, Skin-Friendly & Safe】Avolare cooling comforter is committed to providing the best user experience for you . The fabric can naturally remove static electricity and help you spend every peaceful night comfortably on the bed. Besides, Avolare cooling comforter meets the high safety standard with SGS certification. Its unimaginable breathability and fabric makes it ultra-safety. It's friendly even to sensitive skin and babies. so Avolare comforter is also suitable for naked sleeping. ❄️【Machine Washable】Avolare summer cooling comforter can be machine washable through a laundry net, very easy to clean and saving your time and energy. It is convenient to use in our daily life. Even after countless washes, the color and cooling won’t fade. Besides, no pilling! No deformation! No displacement! NOTE: 1. Remember not to put the cold quilt in the dryer, please place this cool quilt in a cool, well-ventilated place to dry. 2. please confirm the size before buying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tV3aF9ZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avolare","source_asin":"B08T1D3Y81","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-242911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T1D3Y81","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T1D3Y81","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
